        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>&lt;i&gt;Quercus acuta&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;Castanopsis sieboldii&lt;/i&gt;</choice_text>
          <commentary>난대수종이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>&lt;i&gt;Quercus mongolica&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;Corylus heterophylla&lt;/i&gt;</choice_text>
          <commentary>온대 수종이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>&lt;i&gt;Quercus salicina&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;Betula platyphylla&lt;/i&gt;</choice_text>
          <commentary>자작나무는 한대·온대 수종이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>&lt;i&gt;Quercus myrsinifolia&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;Populus maximowiczii&lt;/i&gt;</choice_text>
          <commentary>황철나무는 한대 수종이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2018년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
